<title>SPAIN: Banesto says selling 24.79 pct of Asturiana.</title>
<headline>Banesto says selling 24.79 pct of Asturiana.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Banco Espanol de Credito (Banesto) said it had closed a deal to sell its 24.79 percent stake in Asturiana de Zinc to Glencore International AG.</p>
<p>Banesto said in a note late Wednesday that Glencore would now be Asturiana's main shareholder, having agreed to buy 10 million shares at 1,820 pesetas per share by no later than February 14.</p>
<p>Banesto's stake in the zinc producer will be 7.97 percent after the deal.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
